{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56288","headline":"东郊诗 · 卞震","name":"东郊诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳草又牵爲客恨，白云空寄未闲心。\n（以上均见《吟窗杂录》卷三十三《历代吟谱》。\n）（〖1〗《吟窗杂录》军车田锡序云：「蜀有胡台、李尧夫爲诗人，而卞公之名出其右。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卞震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}